  verdict = "🔴 CLOSED-NEGATIVE / 🧱 WALL (R2 gain + R3 regime-switch both no-free-lunch) — context-adaptive neuromodulation is inert-or-worse than best-fixed on memory AND ideation; regime signal is REAL but sub-threshold; bar unmoved, NO wiring (a_paper_negative_ok) — .verdicts/1284_neuromodulation_gain/H_1284_R2.txt + .verdicts/1284_r3_regime_switch/result.txt"
  group  = "BRAIN-STRUCTURE-LADDER"

@C h1285_amygdala_salience := "H_1285 — AMYGDALA salience: eviction-priority is FALSIFIED (R1, recurrence confound caught by p6 shuffle) but salience-gated SLEEP REPLAY consolidation is 🟢 GREEN realized ENGINE-NATIVE + WIRED on the live immune faculty (R4)" :: hypothesis [slug=1285_amygdala_salience group=BRAIN-STRUCTURE-LADDER]
