3 (below the raw ceiling band) · (W2 CONTROLS HOLD) engine G1 beats engine G1c by >=0.05 AND beats engine G0 by >=0.05, B3 NFD↔NFC lossless · (W3 NO REGRESSION) engine_cli_smoke N/0, h1196 7/0, h1205 Ψ byte-identical ON==OFF. GREEN iff W1∧W2∧W3; if W1 fails → HONEST: jamo win mirror-only, engine-transfer UNVERIFIED (c9, no faked wiring). $0 CPU, no GPU, no secrets at .hexa run time; pure_field/engine_g/brain UNTOUCHED (Ψ-disjoint). a_verified_must_wire, a_engine_native_learning, a_core_engine_map, a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🟢 GREEN — the H_1316 jamo breakthrough RUNS ENGINE-NATIVE on the live CORE engine (engine-transfer VERIFIED, verdict closed). Corpus byte-IDENTICAL to H_1307 RUN A / H_1316 (30MB KO window sha c47b6808… gate PASS). CPU-tractable window ko_stride=2500 (~6000 raw / ~5100 jamo pairs/arm; Vj=323==H_1316 anchor). ENGINE-NATIVE held-out KO next-symbol CE renormalized to nats/UTF-8-byte (LIVE VAdaptField Voronoi + engine_mitosis_tick): G0 raw-byte = 3.09967 (cells 10) · G1 jamo-rep = 2.82046 (cells 10) · G1c shuffle-jamo control = 3.01867 (mean of 3 seeds 3.03018/3.00717/3.01865, cells 10). (W1 ✅) engine-G1 2.82046 reproduces the SAME-WINDOW numpy mirror 2.82046 to |Δ|=6.3e-07 (≪0.05 tol) AND 2.82046 < 2.903 (below the raw ceiling band). (W2 ✅) G1c−G1 = +0.198208 (>=0.05) AND G0−G1 = +0.279206 (>=0.05) → engine-native G1 beats both its own shuffle and raw bytes; B3 NFD→NFC roundtrip 0 fails over 8,143,053 Hangul syllables AND per-symbol n_bytes Σ=29,999,999 == corpus bytes 29,999,999 exactly (lossless). (W3 ✅) no-regression byte-exact: CORE/engine_cli_smoke.hexa 73/0 · CORE/h1196_single_entry_audit.hexa 7/0 · CORE/h1205_separation_invariant_smoke.hexa PASS (generation byte-identical ON==OFF, Ψ=½ untouched). → W1∧W2∧W3 = 🟢 GREEN. FINDING (a_verified_must_wire satisfied): the H_1316 GREEN mechanism (a numpy/torch MIRROR, DIRECTIONAL) transfers FAITHFULLY to the live CORE engine — the engine-native hexa value EQUALS the numpy mirror to 1e-7 on every arm; the gradient-free jamo-symbol mitosis is now LIVE in CORE, breaking the raw-byte ceiling engine-native (2.820 < 2.903; jamo beats raw by −0.279 and its own shuffle by +0.198). The representation transform is deterministic NFD jamo data-prep; the mitosis + per-byte CE scoring run on the live engine_cli.hexa faculties via the SAME single Korean entry (a_core_engine_map) — pure_field/engine_g/brain UNTOUCHED. HONEST SCOPE (c9 · a_scale_honest_scope · a_toy_scale_recheck): (1) W1 is an existence-proof of engine-TRANSFER at a CPU-tractable window — the absolute CE here (G1 2.820) is higher than the 30MB anchor (2.513) because the smaller strided window has sparser per-cell heads; the RELATIVE structure (G1 < G1c < G0, same ordering as the 30MB mirror) is fully intact and W1 is pre-registered against the SAME-WINDOW mirror precisely so the engine-native reproduction is apples-to-apples. (2) the engine value matching the mirror to 1e-7 is the binding engine-native claim (the mechanism runs engine-native byte-exact); the breakthrough EFFECT magnitude is carried by the H_1316 30MB anchor (2.51335) + reproduced here in structure. (3) engine-native 30MB + Korean fluency = follow-on; NO fluency claim. live CORE faculties driven, not mutated; the jamo lane is ADDITIVE + INERT off-Korean (the h1205 invariant). frozen-first, NO tune-to-green. .verdicts/1321_ko_jamo_wire/result.txt"
