es (H_1316/1321/1322): the tag is the substrate-level 'select the faculty', so anima's separate EN+KO faculties coexist for the SAME structural reason; H_1335 🧱 control-technicality is now closed 🟢. HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope · a_toy_scale_recheck): mirror DIRECTIONAL realized in the engine-native rung (a SEPARATE deterministic instance re-scoring the seed-invariant bars, NOT a numpy-byte match); TOY synthetic 1-D continuum (N=21, deterministic — tests the STRUCTURE of tag-separated coexistence, NOT scaled/human bilingualism); TAG_GAIN=1.0 FIXED (sweep non-gating); NO injected boundary/persona/RLHF, labels enter only at the A-fit/B-fit not at test (p1/p2/p3/p6); NOT an emit gate (a_autonomy_over_hardcode); NO human-bilingualism claim. NEXT: real-corpus/scaled bilingual carving · the gain≥2.0 sweep curiosity · brain-side wiring of the tagged CP read into emit/recall (currently a measurement lane). .verdicts/1339_whorf_bilingual_tagged_r3/result.txt"
