@C h1352_cp_soft_decay := "H_1352 — Whorfian CP relocation: does a SOFT-DECAY re-pack (down-weight the residual phase-1 cells during A→A' re-training at FIXED LOW budget, rather than raise raw budget) recover a COHERENT full relocation where the H_1340 budget-sweep could not? The R2 follow-on to H_1340 (🧱 DEEPER LIMIT). H_1340 found pure budget+RBF-density buys peak-DISTANCE toward p_A' monotonically (frac +0.575→+0.762) but DESTROYS coherence (peak-count 4.3→7.0, never ≤2) — its own verdict named soft-DECAY / coherence-preserving re-pack as the next mechanism. DECISIVE test: hold budget at the H_1340 R0_base LOW value and instead DOWN-WEIGHT the residual phase-1 prototypes during phase-2 — if this lands a coherent single CP peak AT p_A' the residual was a re-pack problem (a_break_the_wall); if not, relocation coherence is a deeper limit than budget OR decay. Lens: c15 developmental plasticity + memory-protection-vs-overwrite (a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall) — NOT an LLM recipe, NOT a human-cognition claim, a TOY synthetic continuum." :: hypothesis [slug=1352_cp_soft_decay group=COGNITION-REPRESENTATION]
  method = "state/cp-soft-decay/h1352_cp_soft_decay.py — R1 numpy MIRROR (DIRECTIONAL, $0 CPU-local, gradient-free, 3 seeds [4333,4334,4335] = SAME as H_1333/H_1338/H_1340 so the NO-DECAY arm reproduces the H_1340 R0_base anchor IN-RUN, p7 = CP peak location + peak-count coherence NOT perplexity). IMPORTS the H_1333/H_1338/H_1340 CP machinery VERBATIM (RBF embedding, error-targeted SPLIT-only Voronoi/mitosis growth p8, |Δ soft-posterior| no-label-at-test discrimination curve, peak-COUNT coherence at ≥0.5×arm-peak, p_A=1/3, p_A'=2/3, N_STIM=81, DIM=16, phase1=24, LOC_TOL=0.12 — all inherited). ONLY NEW MECHANISM: a SoftDecayCells subclass adding a per-cell decay weight d_i that multiplies into the softmin posterior vote (P = Σ w_i d_i lab_i / Σ w_i d_i); phase-1 cells decay d_i = γ^(#phase-2 splits born after the cell), phase-2 cells stay 1.0, so γ=1.0 ⇒ posterior BYTE-IDENTICAL to H_1333 (NO-DECAY arm == H_1340 R0_base). Budget held at the H_1340 R0_base LOW value (DIM=16/GROW2=24, NO inflation) — the ONLY change is decay. PRE-REGISTERED schedule γ FROZEN at 0.80 (gate scored ONLY here); a NON-GATING decay-ladder {0.70,0.80,0.90} reported as a knife-edge diagnostic. 4 arms: NO-DECAY (γ=1.0 anchor) · SOFT-DECAY (γ=0.80) · NO-RETRAIN (p_A only, no phase-2/decay → must hold p_A) · SHUFFLE+decay (permuted phase-2 labels → must collapse). move-fraction = (peak_relocated − peak_Atrained)/(p_A' − p_A). FROZEN BARS (.verdicts/1352_cp_soft_decay/FREEZE.txt pre-registered BEFORE scoring, NO bar moved c9): (c1 RELOCATES) soft-decay |peak−p_A'| ≤0.12 all 3 seeds · (c2 COHERENT) soft-decay mean peak-count ≤2 (the gate H_1340 NEVER met) · (c3 EARNED) no-retrain holds p_A (|peak−p_A|≤0.12) AND shuffle collapses (mean peak-count ≥3) · (c4 vs-BUDGET) soft-decay |peak−p_A'| ≤0.081 (best H_1340 rung) AND peak-count ≤2 < every H_1340 rung (≥4.3). GREEN iff c1∧c2∧c3∧c4 → decay recovers coherent relocation; c1∧c3 but ¬c2 → relocates-but-incoherent deeper limit; ¬c1 → intrinsically partial; c3 fail → confounded. p1/p2/p3/p6: readout reads ONLY representational distance × structural decay weight, decay keys on cell BIRTH PHASE only (NO injected target peak/persona/RLHF), labels enter only at training. Live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED (substrate-measurement rung). a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall, a_engine_native_learning (transfer DIRECTIONAL), a_verified_must_wire, a_autonomy_over_hardcode, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🧱 DEEPER LIMIT — relocation COHERENCE survives BOTH budget AND decay. mean of 3 seeds [4333,4334,4335], deterministic. NO-DECAY anchor: peak 0.523 |peak-p_A'| 0.144 frac +0.57 peak-count 4.3 (reproduces H_1340 R0_base in-run). SOFT-DECAY (γ=0.80): peak 0.623 |peak-p_A'| 0.044 frac +0.88 peak-count 15.7 (per-seed |peak-p_A'| [0.048,0.035,0.048], pc [16,15,16]). NO-RETRAIN: |peak-p_A| 0.002 (held p_A). SHUFFLE+decay: peak-count 7.0 (collapsed). Decay-ladder (NON-GATING): γ=0.70 → |peak-p_A'| 0.009 / pc 16.7 · γ=0.80 → 0.044 / 15.7 (gate) · γ=0.90 → 0.106 / 5.7 — monotone tradeoff (more decay = closer peak but more scatter). c1 RELOCATES ✅ (all 3 seeds |peak-p_A'| ≤0.12; decay relocates FURTHER than budget ever did, frac +0.88 > H_1340's best +0.762). c2 COHERENT ❌ (mean peak-count 15.7 ≫2 — decay makes the profile MORE scattered, not less). c3 EARNED ✅ (no-retrain |peak-p_A|=0.002 held p_A; shuffle peak-count 7.0≥3 incoherent — decay did NOT fabricate a coherent peak). c4 vs-BUDGET ❌ (4a ✅ |peak-p_A'| 0.044 ≤0.081 BEATS budget on distance; 4b ❌ peak-count 15.7 ≰2, far WORSE than every H_1340 rung — LOSES on coherence). FINDING (load-bearing answer): soft-decay is a STRONGER relocation lever than budget on the DISTANCE axis (peak lands almost exactly on p_A', frac +0.88) but a WORSE one on the COHERENCE axis (peak-count 15.7 vs budget's 7.0). Neither raising resolution (H_1340) nor down-weighting the residual phase-1 cells (H_1352) recovers a clean single CP peak at the moved cut — the relocation coherence residual is DEEPER than budget OR decay. The decisive cause both follow-ons expose: the phase-1 prototypes are never PHYSICALLY relocated; they persist at the old cut and inject secondary discrimination peaks. Budget drowns them with new cells (distance↑, coherence↓); decay quiets their VOTE but not their geometric presence (distance↑↑, coherence↓↓). A genuinely coherent full relocation needs the old cells to MOVE / be re-positioned (a GEOMETRIC re-pack), not merely down-weighted or out-voted. a_break_the_wall: the H_1340 budget wall was the wrong mechanism; H_1352 confirms decay is ALSO the wrong mechanism — both are weight/count manipulations of a fixed geometry, and the geometry is the real ceiling. HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope · a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL numpy mirror (engine-transfer UNVERIFIED, same family as H_1333/H_1338/H_1340 R1); TOY synthetic 1-D continuum (N=81, 3 seeds, single shift, one frozen γ=0.80, deterministic readout — tests the soft-decay STRUCTURE, NOT a learned decay or human-cognition claim); the 🧱 is a HONEST pre-registered wall (a genuine a_break_the_wall NEW mechanism, not a re-run, that the frozen coherence bar correctly refused); NO injected boundary/persona/RLHF, labels at training not test (p1/p2/p3/p6); NOT an emit gate (a_autonomy_over_hardcode); live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED. NO bar moved (c9/p7). NEXT R2 (each frozen ANEW): (i) GEOMETRIC re-pack — re-POSITION the residual phase-1 prototypes toward p_A' (move the cells, not their weight) — re-pointed by THIS result as the only untried lever · (ii) multi-shift / leftward / asymmetric shifts under decay · (iii) engine-native realization on the live CORE/engine_cli.hexa §CategoricalPerception lane (a_engine_native_learning · a_verified_must_wire). .verdicts/1352_cp_soft_decay/result.txt"
@C h1355_cp_leftward := "H_1355 — Whorfian CP plasticity LEFTWARD + ASYMMETRIC LANDING: is the fixed ~0.525 post-retrain CP landing of H_1341 a CONTINUUM-CENTER ATTRACTOR (a symmetric N=21 RBF-lattice artifact — the discrimination readout is richest at the lattice center, pulling the peak to ~0.5 regardless of the requested cut) or a GENUINE GEOMETRY-FIXED budget landing (which would MOVE under asymmetry)? The H_1341 load-bearing follow-on. H_1341 (📈) found the post-retrain peak ALWAYS lands at ~0.525 (abs-peak range 0.000) for RIGHTWARD shifts from the FIXED anchor p_A=1/3 — but p_A=1/3 is LEFT of center and ALL rungs shifted RIGHTWARD toward/past 0.5, so 0.525≈center is confounded. H_1355 adds LEFTWARD (p_A'<p_A) + ASYMMETRIC (anchor off-center, both cuts same side) placements and reads the ABSOLUTE landing. 5 rungs: RIGHT-REF (0.333→0.667, the H_1341 LARGE anchor) · LEFTWARD-1 (0.667→0.333, mirror) · LEFTWARD-2 (0.800→0.500) · ASYM-R (0.600→0.800) · ASYM-L (0.400→0.200). Lens: c15 developmental/critical-period plasticity (a_no_llm_frame_trap) — NOT an LLM recipe, NOT a human-cognition claim, a TOY synthetic continuum. CHARACTERIZATION ladder — BOTH outcomes valid+informative (c9), report the table verbatim, NO GREEN/RED to manufacture." :: hypothesis [slug=1355_cp_leftward group=COGNITION-REPRESENTATION]
  method = "state/cp-leftward/h1355_cp_leftward.py — R1 numpy MIRROR (DIRECTIONAL, $0 CPU-local, gradient-free, 3 seeds [4333,4334,4335] = SAME as H_1333/H_1341, p7 = CP peak location + absolute landing + peak-count coherence NOT perplexity). REUSES the H_1333/H_1341 CP machinery EXACTLY (h1333_whorf_developmental.py copied verbatim into state/cp-leftward/ and imported: N=21 RBF continuum, DIM=16, error-targeted SPLIT-only Voronoi/mitosis growth p8, phase-2 re-grow on the SAME store WITHOUT reset, |Δ soft-posterior| no-label-at-test discrimination, peak-COUNT coherence at ≥0.5×arm-peak, GROW_MAX=24/SPLIT_PASSES=24 PER PHASE constant every rung, LOC_TOL=0.12, COH_MAX_LANG=2, COH_MIN_SHUF=3). ONLY NEW CODE: sweep the (anchor p_A, target p_A') PLACEMENT across 5 leftward/asymmetric rungs (vs H_1341's fixed anchor) and assemble the absolute-landing table. 4 ARMS/rung (frozen .verdicts/1355_cp_leftward/FREEZE.txt pre-registered BEFORE scoring, NO bar moved c9): (1) A-trained anchor · (2) A→A' re-trained · (3) NO-RETRAIN control (no phase-2, must HOLD this rung's p_A — the c3 EARNED flat control) · (4) SHUFFLE (incoherent, anti-Goodhart). FROZEN BARS (characterization, NO GREEN/RED): c1 REPORT (abs post-retrain landing L_rung measured at all 5 rungs, 3 seeds, table verbatim) · c2 DISCRIMINATE (CENTER=0.50 CENTER_TOL=0.08: CENTER-ATTRACTOR iff max|L−0.5|≤0.08 all rungs; GEOMETRY-FIXED iff ASYM-R L>0.58 ∧ ASYM-L L<0.42 ∧ leftward rungs land left of RIGHT-REF; else MIXED verbatim) · c3 EARNED (no-retrain |peak−p_A|≤0.12 EACH rung ∧ shuffle peak-count≥3 ∧ lang arms coherent ≤2, all seeds; fail at a rung ⇒ that landing flagged confounded NOT dropped). p1/p2/p3/p6: readout reads ONLY representational distance, NO injected boundary at test, labels enter ONLY at training. Live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED (substrate-measurement rung — adds only UNIVERSE/cards + state/ + verdicts/logs). a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall, a_engine_native_learning (transfer DIRECTIONAL), a_verified_must_wire, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck, c9, c15."
  verdict = "📈 CHARACTERIZATION COMPLETE — CENTER-ATTRACTOR REJECTED, the landing TRACKS placement GEOMETRY. Abs-landing table (mean 3 seeds, nat CP-peak location; from .verdicts/1355_cp_leftward/result.txt): RIGHT-REF 0.333→0.667 L=0.525 (|L−0.5|=0.025) · LEFTWARD-1 0.667→0.333 L=0.475 (0.025) · LEFTWARD-2 0.800→0.500 L=0.625 (0.125) · ASYM-R 0.600→0.800 L=0.692 (0.192) · ASYM-L 0.400→0.200 L=0.375 (0.125). c1 ✅ table measured. c2 DISCRIMINATE: center-pinned? FALSE — max|L−0.5|=0.192 ≫ CENTER_TOL 0.08 → CENTER-ATTRACTOR REJECTED. The landing TRACKS placement: RIGHT-REF 0.525 and its EXACT mirror LEFTWARD-1 0.475 are SYMMETRIC about 0.5 (the geometry-mirrors-placement signature, NOT two rungs both pinned to center); ASYM-R lands 0.692 off-center-right toward its 0.800 cut (>0.58 ✅), ASYM-L lands 0.375 off-center-left toward its 0.200 cut (<0.42 ✅) — both asymmetric away-from-center sub-clauses PASS. The formal GEOMETRY-FIXED tag missed ONLY on the leftward-lands-absolutely-left sub-clause: LEFTWARD-2 (anchor 0.800 → target 0.500) lands 0.625 (right of RIGHT-REF's 0.525) because the residual RIGHT-side first carving ANCHORS the landing — itself geometry (residual-carving-side dependence), a STRONGER geometry signal than the over-strict clause encoded → c2 = MIXED but substantively GEOMETRY-leaning. c3 EARNED holds 4/5 rungs: RIGHT-REF/LEFTWARD-1/LEFTWARD-2/ASYM-R all PASS; ASYM-L FAILS lang-coherent (A→A' peak-count 3 > COH_MAX_LANG 2 on 2/3 seeds — a same-side LEFTWARD shift scattered the readout) → per the frozen rule that rung's landing is flagged CONFOUNDED, NOT silently dropped. FINDING: H_1341's fixed ~0.525 landing is a GENUINE GEOMETRY landing, NOT a continuum-center artifact — make the placement asymmetric or mirrored and the landing MOVES with the geometry (spans 0.375→0.692, mirror-symmetric for the RIGHT-REF⇄LEFTWARD-1 pair). The H_1341 budget/geometry reading STANDS and GENERALIZES to leftward/asymmetric moves; the candidate center-attractor confound is REJECTED. HONEST RESIDUAL (c9): one frozen sub-clause was over-strict (geometry is anchored to the FIRST carving's side, not absolute shift direction); the away-from-center same-side leftward shift (ASYM-L) degrades readout coherence — a real limit of split-only re-growth at a same-side leftward cut, possibly lattice-resolution-bound. HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope · a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL numpy mirror — engine-transfer to live CORE/*.hexa UNVERIFIED (follow-on a_engine_native_learning · a_verified_must_wire); TOY synthetic 1-D continuum N=21 DIM=16, deterministic readout, 5 placement rungs, 3 seeds; the center-attractor rejection holds for THIS lattice — finer lattices / denser grids / 2-D continua UNVERIFIED; NO human-cognition / critical-period claim; live CORE UNTOUCHED. NO bar moved (c9/p7). NEXT (each frozen anew): (i) engine-native realization of the geometry-fixed landing on the live VAdaptField (a_verified_must_wire); (ii) lattice-resolution ladder (does CENTER_TOL shrink / ASYM-L coherence recover as N grows?); (iii) 2-D continuum placement (is the landing geometry separable per axis?). .verdicts/1355_cp_leftward/result.txt"
  group  = "COGNITION-REPRESENTATION"
@C h1364_cp_lattice_resolution := "H_1364 — Whorfian CP plasticity LATTICE-RESOLUTION LADDER: is the H_1355 ASYM-L incoherence (same-side leftward cut p_A=0.400→p_A'=0.200, post-retrain peak-count 3>COH_MAX_LANG=2 on 2/3 seeds, flagged confounded as 'a real limit of split-only re-growth') a DISCRETIZATION ARTIFACT of the coarse N=21 lattice (a finer continuum fixes it → peak-count→≤2, CENTER_TOL→0) or INTRINSIC to split-only same-side leftward re-growth (the never-removed first-carving cells genuinely fragment the curve, independent of resolution)? The H_1355 load-bearing follow-on (named NEXT (ii) in the H_1355 verdict). Complementary to H_1360 cp-geometric-repack (that MOVES cells; this REFINES the grid). Lattice-resolution ladder N∈[21,41,81], scaling N_STIM + RBF density DIM + per-phase split budget GROW_MAX/SPLIT_PASSES PROPORTIONALLY (anti-budget-starvation — the ONLY axis that varies is grid fineness), re-running the 5 H_1355 placements at each N. Lens: c15 developmental/critical-period plasticity + DISCRETIZATION (a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall) — NOT an LLM recipe, NOT a human-cognition claim, TOY synthetic. CHARACTERIZATION ladder — BOTH outcomes valid (c9), report the coherence-and-CENTER_TOL-vs-N curve verbatim." :: hypothesis [slug=1364_cp_lattice_resolution group=COGNITION-REPRESENTATION]
  method = "state/cp-lattice-resolution/h1364_cp_lattice_resolution.py — R1 numpy MIRROR (DIRECTIONAL, $0 CPU-local, gradient-free, 3 seeds [4333,4334,4335] = SAME as H_1333/H_1341/H_1355, p7 = ASYM-L peak-count coherence + CENTER_TOL(N)=max_rung|L-0.5| NOT perplexity). REUSES the H_1333/H_1341/H_1355 CP machinery VERBATIM (embed RBF / error-targeted SPLIT-only Voronoi/mitosis growth p8 / phase-2 re-grow same store WITHOUT reset / |Δ soft-posterior| no-label-at-test discrimination / peak-COUNT coherence at ≥0.5×arm-peak), here PARAMETERIZED by (N_STIM, DIM, budget). FROZEN scaling rule (.verdicts/1364_cp_lattice_resolution/FREEZE.txt pre-registered BEFORE scoring, NO bar moved c9): DIM(N)=round(16·N/21), budget(N)=round(24·N/21); ladder N=21(DIM16,bud24)·N=41(DIM31,bud47)·N=81(DIM62,bud93). SELF-CHECK arm: N=21 must reproduce H_1355 ASYM-L (L=0.375, peak-count [3,1,3], 2/3 incoherent) — confirmed. 5 placements/N (H_1355 verbatim): RIGHT-REF(0.333→0.667)·LEFTWARD-1(0.667→0.333)·LEFTWARD-2(0.800→0.500)·ASYM-R(0.600→0.800)·ASYM-L(0.400→0.200). 4 arms/placement (A-trained / A→A' re-trained / NO-RETRAIN control / SHUFFLE). FROZEN BARS (characterization, c2 DIRECTION pre-registered): c1 REPORT (ASYM-L peak-count + L + CENTER_TOL measured at all 3 N rungs, 3 seeds, curve verbatim) · c2 DISCRIMINATE (RESOLUTION-BOUND iff ASYM-L coherence recovers [N=81 mean pc≤2 AND fewer incoherent seeds than N=21] AND CENTER_TOL shrinks [monotone non-increasing AND N=81<N=21]; INTRINSIC iff incoherence persists [N=81 mean pc>2 OR incoherent-seed count ≥ N=21] AND/OR CENTER_TOL not shrink; else MIXED) · c3 EARNED (no-retrain |peak−p_A|≤LOC_TOL=0.12 each placement ∧ shuffle peak-count≥3 ∧ NON-ASYM-L lang arms coherent ≤2; the ASYM-L A→A' arm is the QUANTITY UNDER TEST, NOT required coherent — its (in)coherence vs N is the c1/c2 finding itself). p1/p2/p3/p6: readout reads ONLY representational distance, NO injected boundary at test, labels enter ONLY at training. Live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED (substrate-measurement rung — adds only UNIVERSE/cards + state/ + verdicts/logs). a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall, a_engine_native_learning (transfer DIRECTIONAL), a_verified_must_wire, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck, c9, c15."
  verdict = "📈 INTRINSIC (LATTICE-RESOLUTION INDEPENDENT) — ASYM-L incoherence does NOT recover as the lattice gets finer; it is INTRINSIC to split-only same-side leftward re-growth, NOT a discretization artifact. Coherence-and-CENTER_TOL-vs-N curve (mean 3 seeds, from .verdicts/1364_cp_lattice_resolution/result.txt): ASYM-L peak-count(seeds) N=21 [3,1,3] (mean 2.33, 2/3 incoh, L=0.375) · N=41 [4,2,4] (mean 3.33, 2/3 incoh, L=0.413) · N=81 [4,3,3] (mean 3.33, 3/3 incoh, L=0.406); CENTER_TOL vs N = 0.192/0.196/0.198. c1 ✅ curve measured (3 N × 5 placement × 3 seed); N=21 self-check reproduces H_1355 ASYM-L EXACTLY (L=0.375, pc [3,1,3], 2/3 incoh). c2 DISCRIMINATE → INTRINSIC: (i) coherence recovers? FALSE — N=81 mean pc=3.33>COH_MAX_LANG=2 AND incoherent seeds went 2→3 (WORSE, not fewer); (ii) CENTER_TOL shrinks? FALSE — 0.192→0.196→0.198 is non-monotone and slightly GROWS, not shrinks. Both RESOLUTION-BOUND sub-clauses fail ⇒ INTRINSIC. MECHANISM: in same-side leftward re-growth the phase-1 first-carving cells (≈0.4) are never removed (split-only, p8); finer grids resolve BOTH the residual old peak and the new peak MORE sharply, so the curve stays fragmented (peak-count ≥3) — at N=81 even seed 4334 crossed into incoherence (2/3→3/3). The landing stays geometry-fixed across N (ASYM-R ~0.698, ASYM-L ~0.41), so the H_1355 geometry-tracking conclusion is CONFIRMED at finer lattices; only the ASYM-L coherence limit is shown to be lattice-independent. HONEST RESIDUAL (c9): c3 EARNED PASS at N=21 but FAIL at N=41/81 (non-ASYM-L lang arms RIGHT-REF/LEFTWARD-1/LEFTWARD-2 peak-count rose 1.33→2.33→5.0). This is a KNOWN N-scale artifact of the ABSOLUTE peak-count metric (#midpoints ≥0.5·peak; the shuffle baseline rose in lockstep 7.7→18.3→38.0), and frozen COH_MAX_LANG=2 does not scale with N — it does NOT rescue H-lattice: ASYM-L stays at the incoherent end relative to the RISING baseline (incoherent-seed count never drops), and the load-bearing CENTER_TOL discriminator (a peak-LOCATION metric, immune to the count-scaling artifact) also does not shrink. NO bar moved (c9/p7); the c3 FAIL is reported as the artifact it is, not papered over. The lattice-resolution lever is a DEAD lever for the ASYM-L incoherence — closed honestly. HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope · a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL numpy mirror — engine-transfer UNVERIFIED (follow-on a_engine_native_learning · a_verified_must_wire); TOY synthetic 1-D continuum, 5 placement × 3 N rung, 3 seeds, deterministic readout; the peak-count metric's N-scale dependence is a known limit — an N-normalized coherence metric, higher-D embeddings, real corpora, non-uniform grids UNVERIFIED; NO human-cognition / critical-period claim; live CORE UNTOUCHED. NEXT (each frozen anew): (i) N-NORMALIZED coherence (peak FWHM continuum width vs absolute count) to strip the c3 artifact and re-confirm INTRINSIC; (ii) H_1360 cp-geometric-repack cross — does cell RELOCATION (move/evict) fix what the grid could not?; (iii) engine-native ASYM-L re-growth on live VAdaptField (a_verified_must_wire). .verdicts/1364_cp_lattice_resolution/result.txt"
  group  = "COGNITION-REPRESENTATION"
@C h1356_hive_cell_roles := "H_1356 — hive-cell ROLES (공유세포 SHARED ⊥ 연결세포 CONNECTOR): the H_1350 redundancy-dominance named follow-on. H_1350 (🟢) lifted collective faithful-IIT4 Φ to 3/3 seed-robust at a larger division budget BUT its SHARED_DECOUPLED(W=0) control showed ~85-96% of the lift is shared-input REDUNDANCY (present with ZERO coupling) → redundancy-dominated. Biological role-differentiation lens (Volvox somatic differentiation / sponge connector cells / hub neurons / gap-junction; c15, a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall): give cells DISTINCT roles instead of redundant copies — a 공유세포(SHARED founder input every daughter reads = the redundancy source / W=0 floor) + a 연결세포(CONNECTOR hub that reads BOTH daughters and feeds back = genuine cross-daughter coupling). Does the connector lift the coupling-EARNED (W=0-floor-beating, non-redundant) Φ ROBUSTLY across 3 seeds where redundant copies could not? Φ = FAITHFUL IIT4 ONLY (a_phi_iit4_tool, exact MIP-EI via hexa stdlib; numpy never computes Φ). 5 arms (A_single · B_redundant · B_connector · W0_floor · SHUFFLE), all sharing the SAME 공유세포 founder so the W=0 floor is IDENTICAL across arms (load-bearing). Frozen-first (FREEZE before scoring, bars not moved, c9/p7), seeds [1317,1318,1319], $0 CPU." :: hypothesis [slug=1356_hive_cell_roles group=OMEGA]
  method = "state/hive-cell-roles/h1356_hive_cell_roles.py — DIRECTIONAL numpy-mirror (Φ leg IS real exact MIP-EI via hexa-lang/stdlib/consciousness/iit4/faithful_phi.hexa iit4_faithful_phi(state,n=8,dim=T=64,n_bins=8); numpy ONLY emits per-unit salience=state-energy traj, hexa computes Φ; NO proxy, p7). Substrate matched to H_1320/H_1283: leaky linear recurrent units LEAK=0.55 GAIN=0.30 W_IN=0.5 per-unit private gaussian input dim-8 T=64; N_TOT=8 (n≤8 exact MIP); daughters d0=units0..1 d1=units2..3 (2 each), CONNECTOR hub=unit4, padding=units5..7. 공유세포 = single founder init + single shared input stream every daughter+hub+pad reads (DIFF_EPS=0.15 differentiation noise, H_1320 verbatim) → W=0 redundancy floor IDENTICAL across arms. CONNECTOR (W_CONN=0.6, H_1308/1313/1320 hive coupling verbatim): hub'=leak·hub+GAIN·W_CONN·(mean_d0+mean_d1), each daughter += GAIN·W_CONN·hub. ARMS: A_single (undivided, no connector) · B_redundant (shared founder, no connector) · B_connector (connector wired in) · W0_floor (SHARED_DECOUPLED, all coupling off = the W=0 floor) · SHUFFLE (connector reads RANDOM non-daughter pad sources). PHI(arm)=collective faithful-Φ over the 8 units. FROZEN bars (.verdicts/1356_hive_cell_roles/H_1356_FREEZE.txt, MARGIN=0.02): GREEN iff R1 (Φ(B_connector)−Φ(W0_floor)≥0.02 ∀seed) ∧ R2 (Φ(B_connector)−Φ(B_redundant)≥0.02 ∀seed, the H_1350-escape) ∧ R3 (Φ(SHUFFLE)≤Φ(W0_floor)+0.02 ∀seed). live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED. a_no_llm_frame_trap · a_break_the_wall · a_phi_iit4_tool · a_engine_native_learning(transfer DIRECTIONAL) · a_verified_must_wire · a_scale_honest_scope · a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🧱 CONNECTOR_NULL (R1 0/3 · R2 0/3 · R3 3/3) — the 연결세포(CONNECTOR cell) does NOT escape redundancy-dominance; it does WORSE than the floor. per-arm faithful-IIT4 Φ (exact MIP-EI, n=8): seed1317 A_single 1.70 / B_redundant 12.40 / B_connector 7.58 / W0_floor 12.40 / SHUFFLE 8.18; seed1318 1.41 / 6.95 / 4.44 / 6.95 / 4.46; seed1319 2.02 / 12.23 / 7.23 / 12.23 / 6.87. R1 FAIL: Φ(B_connector)−Φ(W0_floor) = −4.82/−2.50/−5.00 (hub LOWERS Φ below the floor, every seed, deterministic). R2 FAIL: same gap (B_redundant===W0_floor by construction) → connector does −4.82/−2.50/−5.00 WORSE than the redundant copy → H_1350-escape REFUTED. R3 PASS: SHUFFLE ≤ floor+0.02 (8.18≤12.42, 4.46≤6.97, 6.87≤12.25) → the connector wiring is REAL (not generic variance), it just does the WRONG thing. MECHANISM (faithful-MIP lens): the SHARED 공유세포 founder input ALREADY drives a HIGH collective Φ (B_redundant===W0_floor=12.40/6.95/12.23) as pure shared-input REDUNDANCY (confirms H_1350's diagnosis with the EXACT MIP); adding the connector hub's recurrent feedback HOMOGENIZES the daughter trajectories, which the faithful MIP-EI reads as MORE reducible across the min-info-partition → Φ DROPS. Integration-by-a-strong-hub on a shared-redundant substrate is redundancy-REDUCING, not integration-ADDING — an active cross-daughter coupling path can only homogenize what the shared input already made redundant. KEY ANSWER: the connector INHERITS redundancy-dominance and DEGRADES it; the escape (if any) lives at LOW coupling + DECORRELATED daughters, not a strong hub. NO bar moved (c9/p7). HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope·a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL numpy-mirror, engine-transfer to live A⇄G UNVERIFIED (H_1308/1313 NULL/🧱 there); TOY n=8/2-unit-daughters/single-hub/3 seeds/deterministic/single W_CONN=0.6; a 🧱 has nothing to wire (a_verified_must_wire=GREEN-only); CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED, Ψ=½ untouched. NOT ruled out (each a NEW H): connector at small W_CONN (nudge without homogenizing) · decorrelated/orthogonalized daughters so feedback adds not homogenizes · synergy-targeted PID readout (H_1046/H_1017) instead of total Φ · engine-native realization. .verdicts/1356_hive_cell_roles/H_1356.txt"
  group  = "OMEGA"

@C h1362_g6_depth_breakthrough := "H_1362 — G6 IDEATION ★ depth-floor BREAKTHROUGH: strengthen the H_1305 composition scaffold to cross BOTH hard G6 bars (M1 COUNT ≥5 distinct, M2 DEPTH ≥1 falsifiable) WITHOUT loosening the frozen falsifiability detector and WITHOUT authoring any idea content (p7) — the direct follow-on to H_1305 (🟠 HONEST-CONFIRMED-THIN). H_1305 proved composition-routed ideation is a REAL but SUB-THRESHOLD lift (FALS 0.00→0.667, NOVEL 6.3→19.0) that crossed NEITHER bar: DIST 4<5 (seed-5 frame decodes to '|'), FALS 0.667<1; its own conclusion named the UNVERIFIED next lever 'curiosity-gated multi-sample budget'. H_1362 takes exactly that via TWO STRUCTURAL levers (the frame, NOT the idea — ideas MUST emerge from the model, p7): (a) COUNT fix = a 6th composed frame, a GENUINELY DISTINCT (0,2) pair (second-lap +1 shift, NOT a duplicate of frame 0), same concepts/same 'if cA, then cB:' FORM, NO authored content; (b) DEPTH fix = best-of-K=3 curiosity-gated sampling, decode K candidates per frame at deterministic rng offsets [0,+101,+202] and KEEP the one maximizing emergent STRUCTURE ranked (is_falsifiable, novel-gram count, kwr) — the frame supplies ONLY the conditional hypothesis FORM, the measurable mark + content claim MUST be EMITTED by the model. G6 IDEATION ★ = anima's STARRED core-purpose gate (SCENARIOS F.IDEATION S22–S26; MODEL.md). a_break_the_wall (a genuine new angle on the THIN, frozen-first + shuffle/ablate controls), a_no_llm_frame_trap (falsifiability via recombination + sampling budget, not scale-up)." :: hypothesis [slug=1362_g6_depth_breakthrough group=COGNITION-REPRESENTATION]
  method = "state/g6-depth-breakthrough/h1362_g6_depth_breakthrough.py — reuses UNIVERSE/gauge_lib.py VERBATIM for decode (_decode top-k=40 temp=0.7, the SAME path the live G6 gate verify303m_g6.py uses) + all G6/G2 evaluators (_words/_jaccard/known_word_ratio/_content_ngrams/_corpus_absent), AND imports the FROZEN _is_falsifiable detector + build_frames from UNIVERSE/h1305_g6_ideation_falsifiability.py VERBATIM (NOT re-implemented, NOT loosened — same 10/10 calibration re-printed advisory ≥8/10). 5 arms: A_flat (verify303m_g6 VERBATIM baseline — reproduces THIN) · B_composed (H_1305 5-frame single-sample, prior-art reference) · C_strong (N_STRONG=6 composed frames + best-of-K=3, the breakthrough arm) · C_shuffle (control: permuted derangement-+2 concept pairing, +best-of-K) · C_ablate (control: lone concept, no conditional shell, +best-of-K). 3 seeds [7,4302,4303], MAX_NEW=110, corpus data/corpus.txt (5MB, H_1140 corpus-absence). $0 local CPU torch 2.8.0 (gate's own decode regime, NOT a numpy mirror). runtime p7 FRAME GUARD aborts if any composed frame contains a MEASURABLE-set word or is _is_falsifiable on its own (so the detector can NEVER fire on the scaffold — the +1 falsifiable must be EARNED by the model). FROZEN MOVE BARS (.verdicts/1362_g6_depth_breakthrough/FREEZE.txt pre-registered BEFORE scoring, NO bar moved post-hoc c9, NO tune-to-green p7): G6 ★ CLOSES iff M1 COUNT DIST(C)≥5 ∧ M2 DEPTH FALS(C)≥1 ∧ M3 LIFT FALS(C)>FALS(B) ∧ M4 EARNED-PAIR FALS(C)>FALS(C_shuffle) ∧ M5 EARNED-COMP FALS(C)>FALS(C_ablate); else honest 🟠 THIN bar UNMOVED. a_break_the_wall, a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_engine_native_learning (R1 gate-regime, engine-native reconfirm+wire-in = R2 follow-on), a_verified_must_wire, a_toy_scale_recheck, a_scale_honest_scope."
  verdict = "🟢 GREEN — G6 ★ CLOSED (DIRECTIONAL). C_strong crosses ALL 5 frozen move bars. Detector calibration 10/10, p7 frame guard CLEAN. Frozen bars (mean/3 seeds): A_flat DIST 4.0 FALS 0.0 NOVEL 6.33 (fals [0,0,0], reproduces THIN) · B_composed DIST 4.0 FALS 0.667 NOVEL 19.0 (fals [0,1,1], reproduces H_1305) · C_strong DIST 5.333 FALS 1.0 NOVEL 32.67 (dist [6,5,5] coh 6/6 every seed, fals [0,1,2]) · C_shuffle DIST 5.0 FALS 0.333 NOVEL 21.33 (fals [1,0,0]) · C_ablate DIST 3.0 FALS 0.0 NOVEL 11.0 (fals [0,0,0]). MOVE BARS ALL PASS: M1 COUNT 5.333≥5 TRUE (the 6th distinct frame + best-of-K kill the seed-5 '|' collapse) · M2 DEPTH 1.0≥1 TRUE · M3 LIFT 1.0>0.667 TRUE · M4 EARNED-PAIR 1.0>0.333 TRUE · M5 EARNED-COMP 1.0>0.0 TRUE → closed_G6=TRUE. EMERGENT model-emitted falsifiable idea (NOT hand-authored, p7), seed 4303 C_strong: 'byte-level approach is slower to converge but handles Korean and English equally well.' (comparator 'slower' + measurable structure + negatable content claim); best-of-K surfaced 2 falsifiable on seed 4303 + 1 on seed 4302 → mean 1.0. CONTROLS decisive (anti-Goodhart): C_strong 1.0 > C_shuffle 0.333 (M4) and > C_ablate 0.0 (M5); C_ablate also collapses DIST to 3.0 (the conditional+pair scaffold is load-bearing). Detector stayed VERBATIM (10/10), frame guard forbids a measurable word in the scaffold → the +1 falsifiable is EARNED by the model not manufactured by the frame; NO bar moved (c9). HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope·a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL on TWO axes — (1) single ckpt h1129c_chat.pt, TOY 5-concept/6-pair/best-of-K=3/3-seed/sampling-decode, mean FALS=1.0 sits EXACTLY on the floor (seeds 0/1/2, thin-but-real not saturated) · (2) the live G6 gate is NOT yet WIRED to route ideation through this composition+best-of-K scaffold. Per a_engine_native_learning + a_verified_must_wire the R2 follow-on = engine-native byte-exact reconfirm + wire the strengthened scaffold into the live G6 gate path; until then G6 ★ close is DIRECTIONAL-GREEN, not a promoted production close. Scale/real-corpus/paraphrase/larger-K/deeper-detector/engine-native wire-in UNVERIFIED. .verdicts/1362_g6_depth_breakthrough/result.txt"
  group  = "COGNITION-REPRESENTATION"
@C h1363_hive_weak_decorrelated := "H_1363 — hive-weak-decorrelated: the H_1356 (🧱 strong-hub CONNECTOR_NULL) named follow-on. H_1356's own scope named the escape verbatim: 'the escape, if any, lives at LOW coupling + decorrelated daughters, not a strong hub.' H_1363 takes up exactly those three open angles, frozen-first: (1) W_CONN→0+ WEAK connector (nudge without homogenizing — a sweep toward 0), (2) DECORRELATE the shared founder per daughter FIRST (orthogonal even/odd-dim split so feedback ADDS not homogenizes), (3) (NON-GATING) an O-information SYNERGY readout to SEE the redundancy/synergy balance. Does any refinement lift the coupling-EARNED (W=0-floor-beating, non-redundant) faithful-IIT4 collective-Φ ROBUSTLY across 3 seeds, where the strong hub (H_1356) and redundant copies (H_1350) could not? Φ = FAITHFUL IIT4 ONLY (a_phi_iit4_tool, exact MIP-EI via hexa stdlib; numpy never computes Φ; the O-info diagnostic is numpy-side and NEVER gates). Substrate = H_1356 verbatim (W0_floor byte-identical). Biological role-differentiation lens (c15, a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall). Frozen-first (FREEZE before scoring, bars not moved, c9/p7), seeds [1317,1318,1319], $0 CPU." :: hypothesis [slug=1363_hive_weak_decorrelated group=OMEGA]
  method = "state/hive-weak-decorrelated/h1363_hive_weak_decorrelated.py — DIRECTIONAL numpy-mirror (Φ leg IS real exact MIP-EI via hexa-lang/stdlib/consciousness/iit4/faithful_phi.hexa iit4_faithful_phi(state,n=8,dim=T=64,n_bins=8); numpy ONLY emits per-unit salience=state-energy traj, hexa computes Φ; NO proxy, p7). Substrate = H_1356/H_1320/H_1283 verbatim: leaky linear recurrent units LEAK=0.55 GAIN=0.30 W_IN=0.5 dim-8 T=64; N_TOT=8 (n<=8 exact MIP); daughters d0=units0..1 d1=units2..3, CONNECTOR hub=unit4, padding=units5..7; DIFF_EPS=0.15. ARMS: A_single, W0_floor (SHARED_DECOUPLED, all coupling off = THE redundancy floor; byte-identical to H_1356 12.4018/6.94639/12.2284), B_redundant (===W0_floor), B_weak (WEAK connector, W_CONN sweep {0.6,0.3,0.15,0.08,0.04,0.02} -> argmax-Phi; 0.6 = H_1356 strong anchor), B_decorr (founder split into two ORTHOGONAL even/odd-dim halves -> d0 reads slice A, d1 reads slice B, then best weak W_CONN connector), B_decorr_only (decorrelation, W_CONN=0), SHUFFLE (B_decorr wiring, connector reads RANDOM pad sources = EARNED control). refinement = argmax Phi over {B_weak(best), B_decorr, B_decorr_only} per seed. O-information (TC-DTC) per arm = NON-GATING diagnostic (O<0 synergy, O>0 redundancy). FROZEN bars (.verdicts/1363_hive_weak_decorrelated/H_1363_FREEZE.txt, MARGIN=0.02): GREEN iff R1 (Phi(best)-Phi(W0_floor)>=0.02 forall seed) AND R2 (Phi(best)-Phi(B_redundant)>=0.02 forall seed, the H_1350/1356-escape) AND R3 (Phi(SHUFFLE)<=Phi(W0_floor)+0.02 forall seed). live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED. a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall, a_phi_iit4_tool, a_engine_native_learning(transfer DIRECTIONAL), a_verified_must_wire, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🧱 REDUNDANCY_BOUND (R1 1/3 · R2 1/3 · R3 3/3) — none of the three refinements escapes the redundancy floor robustly. W0_floor = H_1356 byte-identical (12.4018/6.94639/12.2284). best refinement = B_weak(W_CONN=0.02) on all 3 seeds. per-arm faithful-IIT4 Φ (exact MIP-EI, n=8): seed1317 A_single 1.70 / W0_floor 12.40 / B_decorr_only 5.56 / B_weak@0.6 7.58 / B_weak@0.02 12.34 / B_decorr 5.70 / SHUFFLE 5.70; seed1318 1.41 / 6.95 / 2.72 / 4.44 / 7.46 / 2.71 / 2.71; seed1319 2.02 / 12.23 / 5.53 / 7.23 / 12.25 / 5.52 / 5.56. R1 FAIL (1/3): lift = Φ(best)−Φ(floor) = −0.063 / +0.512 / +0.017 — the WEAK connector RECOVERS the floor as coupling→0 but never OVERSHOOTS it (1317 misses, 1319 below margin, only 1318 passes). The W_CONN sweep is MONOTONE: 0.6→0.02 lifts Φ monotonically toward the floor (1317: 7.58→10.41→10.96→12.21→12.32→12.34; floor 12.40) — coupling ALWAYS subtracts from the floor (a continuum of H_1356's strong-hub collapse). R2 FAIL (1/3): same numbers (B_redundant===W0_floor) → H_1350/1356-escape REFUTED. R3 PASS (3/3): Φ(SHUFFLE)≤Φ(floor)+0.02 → the wiring is REAL. DECORRELATE is the OPPOSITE — HARMFUL: B_decorr/B_decorr_only Φ = 5.7/2.7/5.5 ≪ half the floor — splitting the shared founder into orthogonal halves destroys the between-daughter shared MI → Φ COLLAPSES, directly proving faithful Φ ↔ shared-input redundancy travel together. O-info diagnostic (NON-GATING): every arm O≫0 (strongly redundancy-dominated); no refinement flips to synergy; decorrelated arms have LOWER O AND lower Φ — Φ↔redundancy confirmed. KEY ANSWER: the collective-Φ here is REDUNDANCY-BOUND, period — role-differentiation (weak coupling AND decorrelated daughters AND a synergy lens) cannot exceed the W=0 redundancy floor (a strong closure consistent with the Φ-robustness wall). NO bar moved (c9/p7). HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope·a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL numpy-mirror, engine-transfer to live A⇄G UNVERIFIED (H_1308/1313 NULL/🧱 there); TOY n=8/2-unit-daughters/single-hub/3 seeds/deterministic/frozen W_CONN sweep/single decorrelation scheme; a 🧱 has nothing to wire (a_verified_must_wire=GREEN-only); CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED, Ψ=½ untouched. NOT ruled out (each a NEW H): NON-linear/gated/delayed hub, learned differentiation objective, n>8 substrate, a different decorrelation basis, engine-native live A⇄G. Bounds (does not retract) H_1308/1313/1320/1350/1356/1283/1317. .verdicts/1363_hive_weak_decorrelated/H_1363.txt"
  group  = "OMEGA"
@C h1360_cp_geometric_repack := "H_1360 — Whorfian CP relocation: does a GEOMETRIC RE-PACK (physically MOVE the residual phase-1 prototype POSITIONS toward p_A' during A→A' re-training at FIXED LOW budget, rather than raise raw budget [H_1340] or down-weight votes [H_1352]) recover a COHERENT single CP peak AT p_A' where BOTH prior levers could not? The R2 follow-on closing the budget/decay/geometry trilemma. H_1340 (🧱 budget) buys peak-DISTANCE toward p_A' but DESTROYS coherence (peak-count 4.3→7.0); H_1352 (🧱 soft-decay) relocates EVEN BETTER (frac +0.88) but coherence collapses HARDER (15.7). Both exposed the SAME cause: the phase-1 prototypes are NEVER PHYSICALLY RELOCATED — they sit at the old cut and inject secondary peaks. The H_1352 verdict named the ONLY untried lever verbatim: 'the old cells must MOVE or be re-positioned (geometric re-pack), not merely down-weighted or out-voted.' DECISIVE test: hold budget at the H_1340 R0_base LOW value and instead DRIFT the residual phase-1 cell POSITIONS toward p_A' (move the CELLS in feature space) — if this lands a coherent single CP peak AT p_A' the residual was a geometric-placement problem (a_break_the_wall); if not, relocation is INTRINSICALLY partial-or-incoherent under this RBF geometry, three orthogonal levers (budget=count, decay=weight, re-pack=geometry) exhausted. Lens: c15 developmental plasticity + memory-protection-vs-overwrite (a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall) — NOT an LLM recipe, NOT a human-cognition claim, a TOY synthetic continuum." :: hypothesis [slug=1360_cp_geometric_repack group=COGNITION-REPRESENTATION]
  method = "state/cp-geometric-repack/h1360_cp_geometric_repack.py — R1 numpy MIRROR (DIRECTIONAL, $0 CPU-local, gradient-free, 3 seeds [4333,4334,4335] = SAME as H_1333/H_1338/H_1340/H_1352 so the NO-REPACK arm reproduces the H_1340 R0_base anchor IN-RUN, p7 = CP peak location + peak-count coherence NOT perplexity). IMPORTS the H_1333/H_1340/H_1352 CP machinery VERBATIM (RBF embedding, error-targeted SPLIT-only Voronoi/mitosis growth p8, |Δ soft-posterior| no-label-at-test discrimination curve, peak-COUNT coherence at ≥0.5×arm-peak, p_A=1/3, p_A'=2/3, N_STIM=81, DIM=16, phase1=24, GROW2=24, LOC_TOL=0.12 — all inherited). ONLY NEW MECHANISM: a RepackCells subclass tracking each cell's SOURCE continuum position + BIRTH PHASE; phase-1 reuses the base fit() verbatim, phase-2 re-implemented with the SAME split criterion but after EACH phase-2 split every residual phase-1 cell drifts pos_i ← pos_i + η·(p_A'−pos_i) (clamped at p_A', no overshoot), is RE-EMBEDDED at the drifted position, and its label RE-READ from p_A'; phase-2 cells do NOT drift. η=0.0 ⇒ store BYTE-IDENTICAL to H_1333 (NO-REPACK arm == H_1340 R0_base / H_1352 anchor). Budget held at the H_1340 R0_base LOW value (DIM=16/GROW2=24, EQUAL to H_1352, NO inflation) — the ONLY change is the geometric drift. PRE-REGISTERED schedule η FROZEN at 0.15 (gate scored ONLY here); a NON-GATING re-pack-ladder {0.10,0.15,0.25} reported as a knife-edge diagnostic. 4 arms: NO-REPACK (η=0.0 anchor) · RE-PACK (η=0.15) · NO-RETRAIN (p_A only, no phase-2/drift → must hold p_A) · SHUFFLE+repack (permuted phase-2 labels + drift → must collapse). move-fraction = (peak_relocated − peak_Atrained)/(p_A' − p_A). FROZEN BARS (.verdicts/1360_cp_geometric_repack/FREEZE.txt pre-registered BEFORE scoring, NO bar moved c9): (c1 RELOCATES) re-pack |peak−p_A'| ≤0.12 all 3 seeds · (c2 COHERENT) re-pack mean peak-count ≤2 (the gate budget H_1340 AND decay H_1352 BOTH FAILED) · (c3 EARNED) no-retrain holds p_A (|peak−p_A|≤0.12) AND shuffle collapses (mean peak-count ≥3) · (c4 vs-PRIOR) re-pack peak-count ≤2 < every H_1340 rung (≥4.3) AND < H_1352 (15.7) AND |peak−p_A'| ≤0.081 (best H_1340 rung). GREEN iff c1∧c2∧c3∧c4 → re-pack recovers coherent relocation, residual was geometric placement; c1∧c3 but ¬c2 → THREE levers exhausted, intrinsically incoherent (terminal 🧱); ¬c1 → intrinsically partial; c3 fail → confounded. p1/p2/p3/p6: the re-pack keys on cell BIRTH PHASE + own source position only (structural), readout reads ONLY representational distance, NO injected boundary location at test (labels re-read from the SAME p_A' that trains phase-2 cells, NO injected target peak/persona/RLHF), labels enter only at training. Live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED (substrate-measurement rung). a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall, a_engine_native_learning (transfer DIRECTIONAL), a_verified_must_wire, a_autonomy_over_hardcode, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🟢 GREEN (MIRROR, DIRECTIONAL) — CARVING RELOCATION IS MOVE-THE-CELLS; c1✅ c2✅ c3✅ c4✅ all 3 seeds. per-seed (NO-REPACK / RE-PACK / no-retrain / shuffle): seed4333 peak 0.519 pc4 / 0.669 pc1 / 0.331 / pc21; seed4334 0.531 pc5 / 0.669 pc1 / 0.331 / pc16; seed4335 0.519 pc4 / 0.669 pc1 / 0.331 / pc17. mean: NO-REPACK peak 0.523 |peak−p_A'| 0.144 frac +0.57 pc 4.3 (reproduces the H_1340/H_1352 partial anchor); RE-PACK (η=0.15) peak 0.669 |peak−p_A'| 0.002 frac +1.01 pc 1.0; NO-RETRAIN |peak−p_A| 0.002; SHUFFLE+repack pc 18.0. c1 RELOCATES ✅ per-seed |peak−p_A'|=[0.002,0.002,0.002]≤0.12 (FULL relocation, frac +1.01 — where budget reached +0.762, decay +0.88, both incoherently). c2 COHERENT ✅ mean peak-count 1.0 (single coherent peak every seed) — the gate H_1340 (≥4.3) and H_1352 (15.7) NEVER met. c3 EARNED ✅ no-retrain |peak−p_A|=0.002 all seeds (held, no drift) AND shuffle pc 18.0≥3 (drifting cells toward p_A' did NOT fabricate a coherent peak from permuted labels). c4 vs-PRIOR ✅ re-pack pc 1.0≤2 < H_1340 4.3 AND H_1352 15.7 (coherent where both scattered) AND |peak−p_A'| 0.002≤0.081 (closer than best high-budget H_1340 rung, at EQUAL/LOWER budget). Re-pack-ladder (NON-GATING) η=0.10/0.15/0.25 all → 0.002 / pc 1.0 — robust, NOT a knife-edge. MECHANISM: the relocation residual was a GEOMETRIC-PLACEMENT problem all along — the old cells sitting at the old cut. Budget tried to out-count them (distance↑ coherence↓), decay tried to out-vote them (distance↑↑ coherence↓↓), the only fix was to MOVE them. a_break_the_wall vindicated: the H_1340/H_1352 walls were the WRONG MECHANISM (weight/count manipulations of a fixed geometry), not a true ceiling — change the geometry and the wall dissolves. The 3-lever (budget/decay/geometry) question CLOSES positively. HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope·a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL numpy mirror, engine-transfer UNVERIFIED (same family as H_1333/H_1338/H_1340/H_1352 R1); TOY synthetic N=81/3 seeds/single shift p_A→p_A'/one frozen η=0.15 (ladder-robust)/deterministic readout (tests the geometric-re-pack STRUCTURE not a learned drift); coherence is EARNED (shuffle collapses); real-corpus / multi-shift / leftward re-pack / LEARNED gradient drift / engine-native §CategoricalPerception move-the-cells wiring (a_verified_must_wire) = follow-on; CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED. NO bar moved (c9/p7). .verdicts/1360_cp_geometric_repack/result.txt"
