@C h1359_ko_dedup_novel := "H_1359 — ko-dedup-novel: H_1344 'interpolation beats jamo floor' lane 의 depletion test. H_1344 🟢 는 JM interpolation 이 held-out 한국어 next-symbol CE 를 2.00562 로 내려 jamo 2.51335 floor 아래로 갔으나, honesty 진단상 그 이득은 코퍼스 반복 암기(top-order context SEEN-in-train 70.1% CE|seen 1.65, novel 30% CE|novel 2.88>floor). H_1359 = 반복 암기 제거 후 c1 재시험: (TEST A) NOVEL-CONTEXT-ONLY held-out + (TEST B) DE-DUP 코퍼스에서 JM 이 여전히 2.51335 를 이기는가. 이기면 표상 floor 깨짐(genuine break), 못 이기면 2.513 진짜 표상/데이터-풍부도 floor 확정 + lane DEPLETED(honest 🧱, valid c9). lens a_no_llm_frame_trap·a_break_the_wall. REAL only, toy DIRECTIONAL, CORE UNTOUCHED." :: hypothesis [slug=1359_ko_dedup_novel group=MITOSIS-ENGINE]
  method = "state/ko-dedup-novel/h1359_ko_dedup_novel.py — DIRECTIONAL numpy, $0 CPU-local(16.4s), gradient-free, p7 = held-out next-symbol CE renormalized per UTF-8 byte(NOT perplexity-truth). REAL Korean: r2://phanes/anima-7b/web/kor/shard0000.bytes[0:30M] trim, sha256 ASSERTED c47b6808308d2f73cb92d74f8fdb15c64e6c96e8ed58ae2ef91a7c57fe5dc6ca(== H_1307 RUN A / H_1316 jamo baseline / H_1344, byte-fair; 캐시 sha 일치 시만 재사용, mismatch → STOP, NO synthetic; R2 키 keychain env-only c7). Representation/JM = H_1344 와 동일(Hangul→NFD jamo id 256+rank, non-Hangul→raw byte, n_bytes 합산=원본 UTF-8 byte, Vj=323; p_JM(s|h)=Σ_{k=1..5} λ_k·p̂_k, p̂_1 Laplace 1.0, k≥2 TRAIN order-k count-MLE, unseen→recursive back-off, count FULL TRAIN). λ=[1,2,4,8,16]/31 == H_1344, NOT re-tuned to TEST(anti-Goodhart). TEST A NOVEL-ONLY(PRIMARY GATE): stride-300 even=TRAIN/odd=TEST + FULL-resolution adjacency 로 JM 학습, TEST 위치 중 top-order(4-jamo) context 가 TRAIN top-order set 에 없는 위치만 점수. TEST B DE-DUP: 스트림 walk, 각 위치의 top-order 5-gram STRING(4-jamo+label) 이 이미 등장했으면 eligible 에서 DROP(causal, prior occurrence 만, TEST 누출 없음), 생존 위치 위 stride-300 even/odd 재분할 → JM 재학습 → 점수. Frozen bars(.verdicts/1359_ko_dedup_novel/H_1359_FREEZE.txt, scoring 전, NO 이동 c9/p7): c1 PRESENCE-or-FLOOR(TEST A) CE_A<2.50335 → 🟢 break, ≥ → 🧱 ; c1b DE-DUP 일치(CE_B vs 2.51335 delta+sign) ; c2 EARNED circular-shift surrogate CE_A_shift≥2.46335 ∧ shift−novel≥0.05(아니면 🔴 trivial) ; c3 FLOOR-CONFIRM ¬c1 ∧ c1b 일치 ∧ c2 → honest 🧱(floor real, lane DEPLETED, valid). live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED. a_no_llm_frame_trap · a_break_the_wall · a_engine_native_learning(transfer DIRECTIONAL) · a_verified_must_wire · a_scale_honest_scope · a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🧱 FLOOR-CONFIRM (c1 ❌ ∧ c1b 일치 ✅ ∧ c2 earned ✅) — JM interpolation 은 truly-novel context 에서 jamo 2.51335 floor 를 못 이긴다 → 2.51335 는 (이 윈도·이 표상에서) 진짜 표상/데이터-풍부도 floor 로 확정, H_1344 의 JM-GREEN 은 코퍼스 반복 문자열 암기 artifact, 'interpolation beats jamo' lane DEPLETED. REAL corpus sha c47b6808 PASS, Vj=323, symbol stream 25,501,291. ref: H_1344 GATE 복제(full TEST) A1=2.00562(Δ−0.50773, seen+novel 혼합). TEST A novel-only(12,706 위치=29.9%, m_seen 29,796): CE_A=2.88190 Δfloor +0.36855(c1 thr 2.50335 ❌; H_1344 CE|novel 2.8819 와 정확히 일치=슬라이스 격리 올바름); seen 슬라이스(70.1%) CE 1.64740. TEST B de-dup(causal top-order 5-gram string 제거, eligible 1,733,877/25,501,287=6.8% kept, test 2,890 위치 중 98.5% still-novel-vs-dedup-train): CE_B=4.71364 Δfloor +2.20029(c1b floor 와 같은 방향=못 이김 ✅). c2 EARNED: shift surrogate novel CE 5.81040(shift−novel +2.9285 ≥0.05 ✅, conditioning 파괴→나빠짐) → 남은 (작은) 조건화 신호조차 진짜 jamo-순서 구조에서 옴(랜덤 artifact 아님; de-dup shift 6.37434). 두 독립 경로(novel-filter · corpus de-dup) 모두 동일 결론. MECHANISM: 2.51335 floor 는 'JM 이 아무것도 못 배운다'가 아니라 'novel context 에서 count-MLE 가 줄 수 있는 것이 floor 위에서 끝난다' — H_1344 GREEN 은 메커니즘 차이(반복 저장 능력)를 드러냈을 뿐 표상 floor 를 안 깸. NO bar moved(c9/p7). HONEST SCOPE(a_scale_honest_scope·a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL numpy, toy stride-300 byte-substrate next-symbol CE, NOT fluent decoder, NO Korean-fluency claim; 단일 코퍼스 윈도·단일 frozen λ·단일 stride; de-dup=top-order STRING causal de-dup(의미 de-dup 아님); 더 큰 데이터(novel 문자열량 증가)/다른 표상축(H_1322 featural 은 이미 🧱)/engine-transfer UNVERIFIED; 🧱 라 wire 대상 없음(a_verified_must_wire=GREEN-only); live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED. NOT ruled out(각각 NEW H): data-richness lever(더 큰 윈도)에서 novel-context CE 가 내려가는지 ; jamo 아래/옆 다른 표상축. .verdicts/1359_ko_dedup_novel/H_1359.txt"
  group  = "MITOSIS-ENGINE"
@C h1358_whorf_2d_bounded := "H_1358 — Sapir-Whorf / 2-D categorical perception (CP) warp metric RE-SPECIFIED to a BOUNDED form, R3 of H_1343 (🟠 PARTIAL). H_1343 found the 2-D CP warp decisively PRESENT (c1 ✅; diagonal warps as strongly as axis-aligned, refuting H_1334's grid-geometry read) but its warp metric ratio = mean|Δg|_BETWEEN/mean|Δg|_WITHIN was scale-UNBOUNDED: after training within-|Δg| compresses to ~0 so the ratio explodes to ~45, and a RANDOM carving compresses within too, so the label-shuffle null FLOATED at +9.28 instead of collapsing to chance (c2 FAIL structurally). R3 replaces the ratio with a BOUNDED separation-AUC ∈[0,1] = Mann-Whitney-U P(|Δg|_BETWEEN > |Δg|_WITHIN); chance = 0.5 is a FIXED constant independent of within-compression, so a label-shuffle null MUST collapse to 0.5 if the warp is not earned. METRIC CORRECTION, NOT bar relaxation. Lens: cognitive-science / categorical-perception (c15, a_no_llm_frame_trap) — NOT an LLM recipe, NOT a human-cognition claim, a TOY synthetic 2-D continuum." :: hypothesis [slug=1358_whorf_2d_bounded group=COGNITION-REPRESENTATION]
  method = "state/whorf-2d-bounded/h1358_whorf_2d_bounded.py — R1 numpy MIRROR (DIRECTIONAL, $0 CPU-local, gradient-free, 3 seeds [4334,4335,4336] = SAME family as H_1343/H_1334, deterministic over 2 re-runs exit 4, p7 = a bounded representational-warp metric + label-permutation + component-shuffle controls, NOT perplexity). REUSES the H_1343 RBF/Voronoi machinery VERBATIM (2-D RBF population code · error-targeted SPLIT-only mitosis/Voronoi growth p8 · softmin soft-posterior; 11x11=121 stim; L_DIAG=diag u+v>1.0, L_LSHAPE=L-corner u>0.5&v>0.5), changing ONLY the warp readout. BOUNDED warp metric (pre-registered exactly): learned category coordinate g=soft posterior P(cat=1) (NO hard label/boundary injected); over all 4-neighbour grid pairs partition WITHIN/BETWEEN by the store's OWN learned category; separation-AUC = U_BETWEEN/(|B|*|W|) (Mann-Whitney-U rank form, ties=0.5) ∈[0,1], chance=0.5, AUC->1.0 = perfect warp; NO baseline subtraction (AUC is already a relative rank probability; pre-lang baseline AUC reported as a diagnostic). Secondary NON-gating diagnostic: Cohen's d. DENSITY LADDER K_RBF∈{6,9,12} (production=densest 12, DIM=144, frozen NOW before scoring). FROZEN BARS (.verdicts/1358_whorf_2d_bounded/FREEZE.txt pre-registered BEFORE scoring, NO bar moved c9): (c1 PRESENCE) production both languages EACH seed AND mean AUC ≥ AUC_MIN=0.70 · (c2 EARNED-SHUFFLE) label-permutation null (N_SHUF=200/seed pooled) |mean−0.5| ≤ CHANCE_TOL=0.05 AND each language ≥ null-q95 + SEP=0.10 · (c3 COMPONENT-COUNT) component-shuffle (N_COMP=50, partition tied to a random single feature component median) |AUC−0.5| ≤ COMP_TOL=0.08 both languages · (c4 DIAGONAL) |AUC_diag − AUC_Lshape| ≤ DIAG_TOL=0.15 AND both ≥ AUC_MIN. GREEN iff c1∧c2∧c3∧c4; c1 FAIL→🧱 genuine 2-D limit; c2 FAIL (null STILL floats under bounded metric)→honest 🧱 DEEPER LIMIT; c3 FAIL→🟠; c4 FAIL→🟠. p1/p2/p3/p6: AUC reads ONLY representational distance + the store's OWN learned category; NO injected boundary/persona/RLHF; labels enter only at training, never the warp readout. Live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED (substrate-measurement rung). a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall, a_engine_native_learning (transfer DIRECTIONAL), a_verified_must_wire, a_autonomy_over_hardcode, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🧱 DEEPER LIMIT (deterministic 2 re-runs, exit 4; mean of 3 seeds). Density ladder K_RBF 6/9/12 all L_DIAG=1.0000 L_LSHAPE=1.0000 (saturated). Production K_RBF=12: AUC=1.0000 both languages every seed; baseline-AUC diagnostic L_DIAG=0.930 L_LSHAPE=0.681; component comp-AUC L_DIAG=0.4852 L_LSHAPE=0.5062. c1 PRESENCE ✅ (AUC mean 1.0000 ≥0.70 both). c2 EARNED-SHUFFLE ❌ (pooled null(600) mean=0.9919 → |0.9919−0.5|=0.4919 ≫0.05 FAIL; q95=0.9996 so SEP sub-clause mathematically unreachable). c3 COMPONENT ✅ (|0.4852−0.5|=0.0148, |0.5062−0.5|=0.0062, both ≤0.08 — external random partition collapses to chance). c4 DIAGONAL ✅ (|1.0000−1.0000|=0.0000 ≤0.15, both ≥0.70 — H_1343 diagonal=axis preserved, continues to refute H_1334 grid-geometry read). MECHANISTIC (load-bearing, c9): the bounded AUC removed H_1343's unbounded-ratio explosion and floating null mathematically, but the null still floated at 0.99 because the REAL confound is the SELF-REFERENTIAL partition — the AUC partitions by the store's OWN learned category, and the SPLIT-only Voronoi store packs cells along ANY boundary (shuffled too), so g jumps sharply at whatever boundary it learned, making between>within near-tautological for a well-fitting store (null≈0.99). c3 is the only control with an EXTERNAL language-independent partition and it collapses cleanly → warp is real (not raw variance) but coherence-alone (any carving) reproduces it, so the AUC-vs-own-partition readout cannot isolate the TRUE-language boundary from a random one. Honest structured-negative, NO bar move (c9/p7). DIRECTIONAL numpy mirror (engine-transfer UNVERIFIED), TOY synthetic 2-D continuum 121 stim / 3 seeds / deterministic; NEXT R (H_1359) = fixed-true-partition readout (score the SHUFFLE-trained metric g_shuffle UNDER the TRUE-language WITHIN/BETWEEN partition → a shuffle store packed on the wrong boundary should NOT separate true pairs → AUC→0.5 collapse). .verdicts/1358_whorf_2d_bounded/result.txt"
