@C h1351_jamo_engine_wire := "H_1351 — jamo-engine-wire (a_verified_must_wire wire-in of H_1316/H_1321): the verified Hangul jamo-decomposition next-symbol COUNT-HEAD is promoted to a FIRST-CLASS, ADDITIVE, Ψ-disjoint faculty in the live CORE engine CORE/engine_cli.hexa § KO-JAMO COUNT-HEAD. H_1321 proved the jamo mitosis runs engine-native byte-exact, but its COUNT-HEAD (the per-cell next-symbol count-MLE + Voronoi-grown CE scorer that IS the jamo-beats-raw mechanism) lived ONLY as private helpers (_head_counts/_grow_on/_score_ce_per_byte) inside the THROWAWAY probe CORE/h1321_ko_jamo_wire_probe.hexa, NOT as an engine op (grep 'jamo' CORE/engine_cli.hexa == 0). H_1327 wired a generator §6.5b DECODE consult that biases EMISSION — a DISTINCT surface. Per a_verified_must_wire + a_core_engine_map, a GREEN mechanism is not done until its faculty is OWNED by the engine. H_1351 adds struct JamoHead + ops jamo_head_new/jamo_head_grow/jamo_head_ce/jamo_head_cells/jamo_head_shuffle_targets (+ _jh_* helpers), re-using the engine's OWN VAdaptField Voronoi (vadapt_field_nearest_idx) + engine_mitosis_tick growth (p8) + per-cell count-MLE. ADDITIVE (new struct + new pub fns only; byte path + every existing faculty UNTOUCHED). Ψ-disjoint (pure count-head SCORER, returns CE/cell-count, NEVER an emit/silence decision; pure_field/engine_g/brain UNTOUCHED; no decode-loop call site)." :: hypothesis [slug=1351_jamo_engine_wire group=MITOSIS-ENGINE]
  method = "DETERMINISTIC in-engine fixture ($0, no corpus, no secrets, no GPU): a hidden (L,V) state walks deterministically (nL=(l+v+1)%NL, nV=(l*2+v+3)%NV); the target to predict g(L,V)=(L+2V) mod K depends on BOTH factors. Two VIEWS differ ONLY in whether the count-head SEES the factors — JAMO view exposes L,V as TWO clean feature channels [L/NL, V/NV] (the engine's Voronoi can split each axis → learns g); RAW view collapses them into ONE opaque merged channel [(L*NV+V)/(NL*NV)] (the same coarse Voronoi cannot disentangle the factors → higher CE). This is the H_1316 jamo-STRUCT-beats-raw structure realized as a clean in-engine fixture (NOT a Korean-fluency / 30MB claim). FROZEN (FREEZE before scoring, bars NOT moved, c9/p7): NL=NV=6, K=12, NSYL=2000, even/odd held-out split, GROW_MAX=40, MIN_OWNED=6, SPLIT_THRESH_CE=0.05, LAPLACE=1.0, seed centers [[0.3,0.3,0],[0.7,0.7,0]], deterministic per-position jitter 0.02 (applied to BOTH views, favors neither — avoids the median-split all-ties wall on the discrete factor grid). Metric = held-out next-symbol CE nats/symbol (p7, NOT perplexity). SHUFFLE control (jamo_head_shuffle_targets) permutes the TRAIN context→target PAIRING (head learns a SPURIOUS map) then scores on the TRUE held-out — same vocab K/dim/budget/feature-marginal, ONLY the compositional alignment destroyed (NOTE: a bijective RELABELING of target ids would be CE-INVARIANT, so the control must permute the PAIRING, not relabel — the first attempt fell into this trap and FAILED honestly at shuf−jamo=0.0; frozen-first fix changed the shuffle definition to a pairing-permute, NO bar moved). Smoke cases 92-95 in CORE/engine_cli_smoke.hexa drive the faculty. FROZEN bars (.verdicts/1351_jamo_engine_wire/FREEZE.txt): GREEN iff W1 (FACULTY-PRESENT: jamo head grows >=2 cells AND CE>0) ∧ W2 (JAMO-BEATS-RAW: ce_raw−ce_jamo >= 0.05) ∧ W3 (EARNED: ce_shuf−ce_jamo >= 0.05) ∧ W4 (NO-REGRESSION+Ψ-DISJOINT: engine_cli_smoke N/0, h1196 7/0, h1205 Ψ byte-identical). W2 falsifier ce_jamo>=ce_raw → honest RED (faculty does NOT reproduce the structural win, bar NOT moved); W3 falsifier shuffle ties/beats → RED. $0 CPU, frozen-first, NO tune-to-green. a_verified_must_wire, a_core_engine_map, a_engine_native_learning, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🟢 GREEN — W1∧W2∧W3∧W4. the verified Hangul jamo-decomposition count-head is now a first-class ADDITIVE Ψ-disjoint faculty in the live CORE/engine_cli.hexa engine. ENGINE-NATIVE held-out next-symbol CE (nats/symbol, deterministic, identical over 3 runs): JAMO (two factor channels) = 4.18698 (4 cells) · RAW (opaque-merge channel) = 5.56834 (5 cells) · SHUFFLE (pairing-permuted) = 4.72652 (40 cells). (W1 ✅) jamo head grows 4 cells (>=2) AND CE 4.18698 > 0. (W2 ✅) ce_raw−ce_jamo = 5.56834−4.18698 = +1.38136 (>=0.05) — the decomposed view beats the opaque-merge view. (W3 ✅) ce_shuf−ce_jamo = 4.72652−4.18698 = +0.53954 (>=0.05) — the intact head beats its own pairing-shuffle (the shuffle grows to GROW_MAX=40 cells chasing the destroyed alignment yet still LOSES on held-out — a clean anti-Goodhart signal). (W4 ✅) no-regression byte-exact: CORE/engine_cli_smoke.hexa 90/0 (was 86/0, +4 jamo cases 92-95, deterministic over 3 runs) · CORE/h1196_single_entry_audit.hexa 7/0 (the faculty adds NO new .clm/.kosmos path — it is an engine_cli faculty, not a slot) · CORE/h1205_separation_invariant_smoke.hexa PASS (generation byte-identical ON==OFF, Ψ=½ untouched). → W1∧W2∧W3∧W4 = 🟢 GREEN. FINDING (a_verified_must_wire satisfied): the jamo-decomposition COUNT-HEAD ownership gap is CLOSED — the mechanism that beats raw byte is now OWNED by the engine, not a throwaway probe. HONEST SCOPE (c9 · a_scale_honest_scope · a_toy_scale_recheck): W2/W3 are an IN-ENGINE STRUCTURAL existence-proof on a deterministic synthetic fixture that the engine's OWN faculty reproduces jamo-beats-raw + earned-vs-shuffle — NOT a re-derivation of the 30MB REAL-corpus 2.513 anchor (that is H_1316/H_1321, byte-exact, the source of the real-corpus / scale / fluency claim); this H makes NO Korean-fluency claim of its own. TOY deterministic readout (not a trained net — tests STRUCTURE), synthetic fixture, single paradigm; brain scoring-loop wiring + real-corpus + scale = follow-on. Ψ-disjoint (pure SCORER, no emit/silence; pure_field/engine_g/brain UNTOUCHED; DISTINCT from the H_1327 generator §6.5b decode consult which biases EMISSION). frozen-first, NO bar moved. .verdicts/1351_jamo_engine_wire/result.txt"
  group  = "MITOSIS-ENGINE"
@C h1369_cp_2d := "H_1369 — 2-D categorical perception: does the H_1360 (1-D) MOVE-THE-CELLS relocation win GENERALIZE to a 2-D feature space where the TRUE category partition is a FIXED half-plane LINE (cat=u>p) that SHIFTS p_A=1/3→p_A'=2/3, or does the extra (irrelevant) dimension v REINTRODUCE the split-only incoherence H_1364 found? H_1360 🟢 proved carving relocation is move-the-cells on a 1-D AXIS (boundary=POINT); H_1364 proved split-only re-growth incoherence is INTRINSIC at finer lattices. DECISIVE 2-D test: at a FIXED LOW budget, physically DRIFT the residual phase-1 cells' u-coordinate toward the moved boundary LINE u=p_A' (v=irrelevant axis untouched) — if this lands a COHERENT thin discrimination ridge AT p_A', DISTINCT from the split-only (H_1364) ablation, the geometric-placement read generalizes to 2-D; if the ridge fragments even when cells move, move-the-cells is a 1-D-only artifact (honest 🧱). Lens: c15 developmental plasticity + memory-protection-vs-overwrite (a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall) — NOT an LLM recipe, NOT a human-cognition claim, a TOY synthetic 2-D continuum. Re-fire of a storm-interrupted lane." :: hypothesis [slug=1369_cp_2d group=COGNITION-REPRESENTATION]
  method = "state/cp-2d/h1369_cp_2d.py — R1 numpy MIRROR (DIRECTIONAL, $0 CPU-local, gradient-free, 3 seeds [4333,4334,4335], p7 = ridge centroid location + bounded ridge-CONCENTRATION coherence NOT perplexity). Reuses family machinery: 2-D RBF population code (H_1343), error-targeted SPLIT-only Voronoi/mitosis growth (p8, H_1343/H_1360), softmin-vote soft posterior, geometric RE-PACK of residual phase-1 cells (H_1360). 13×13=169 stimulus grid, K_RBF=8 (DIM=64, LOW, fixed across arms), phase-1 GROW1=48, phase-2 GROW2=48 (NO inflation, identical every arm). TRUE partition cat=int(u>P_CUT), P_A=1/3→P_A'=2/3 (vertical line, v=irrelevant axis). ONE NEW MECHANISM = 2-D geometric RE-PACK: each phase-1 cell tracks SOURCE 2-D position + BIRTH PHASE; after EACH phase-2 split every residual phase-1 cell's u drifts u←u+η·(p_A'−u) (clamped at p_A', v fixed), re-embedded, label re-read from the new line; phase-2 cells do NOT drift. η FROZEN 0.15 (NON-GATING ladder {0.10,0.15,0.25} robust); η=0.0 = split-only re-growth (= the H_1364 ablation). 4 arms: SPLIT-ONLY (η=0.0) · RE-PACK (η=0.15) · NO-RETRAIN (p_A only → must hold old line) · SHUFFLE+repack (permuted labels → must collapse). 2-D metrics: DISCRIM FIELD D=max|Δ posterior| to 4 grid neighbors; RIDGE=nodes≥0.5·max; peak_u=u of ridge centroid (RELOCATES); R1 NCOMP=#4-connected ridge components; R2 (a_break_the_wall, frozen-first) COH2D=U_CONC·(1−RIDGE_FRAC), U_STD_REF=0.20 (bounded concentration). FROZEN BARS (.verdicts/1369_cp_2d/FREEZE.txt pre-registered BEFORE scoring, NO bar moved c9/c16): (c1 RELOCATES) re-pack |peak_u−p_A'|≤0.12 all 3 seeds · (c2 COHERENT R1) re-pack mean NCOMP≤1 · (c3 EARNED R1) no-retrain holds p_A |peak_u−p_A|≤0.12 AND shuffle NCOMP≥2 · (c4 DISTINCT R1) split-only NCOMP≥2 OR |peak_u−p_A'|>0.12; R2 (pre-registered in FREEZE §R2 BEFORE R2 scoring): c2' re-pack COH2D≥0.50 · c3b' shuffle COH2D≤0.20 · c4' re-pack COH2D≥split-only+0.10 OR split-only short. p1/p2/p3/p6: discrimination reads ONLY representational distance, NO injected boundary at test, re-pack keys on BIRTH PHASE + own 2-D source position (structural, NO injected target/persona/RLHF), labels enter only at training. Live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED (substrate-measurement rung). a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall, a_engine_native_learning (transfer DIRECTIONAL), a_verified_must_wire, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck, c9, c15, c16."
  verdict = "🟢 GREEN (R2, MIRROR, DIRECTIONAL) — MOVE-THE-CELLS GENERALIZES TO 2-D; R1 c1✅ c2✅(NCOMP) c4✅ but c3b❌ (NCOMP SATURATED on the shuffle smear, honestly caught) → a_break_the_wall R2 BOUNDED metric → c1✅ c2'✅ c3'✅ c4'✅. per-seed (deterministic, all 3 identical): SPLIT-ONLY peak_u 0.412 (|·−p_A'|=0.254) / RE-PACK peak_u 0.708 (|·−p_A'|=0.042) / no-retrain peak_u 0.375 (|·−p_A|=0.042). R1: NCOMP RE-PACK 1.0 / SPLIT-ONLY 1.0 / SHUFFLE 1.0 → c3b FAIL (the shuffle SMEAR fills 116/169 nodes, meanD 0.683, u-spread std 0.281 — a grid-filling noise field is trivially 4-connected so NCOMP=1; the SAME unbounded-metric failure mode H_1343 documented; the c3b control DID its job). R2 (a_break_the_wall, bounded ridge-CONCENTRATION COH2D=U_CONC·(1−RIDGE_FRAC), frozen-first NOT a relaxation): COH2D RE-PACK 0.689 / SPLIT-ONLY 0.538 / SHUFFLE 0.000 → c2' 0.689≥0.50 PASS · c3b' SHUFFLE 0.000≤0.20 PASS (the smear's u-spread 0.281≥U_STD_REF→U_CONC=0→COH2D=0, the move does NOT fabricate a concentrated ridge from permuted labels) · c4' 0.689≥0.538+0.10 PASS (move-the-cells MORE concentrated AND split-only stays short at 0.254). c1 RELOCATES ✅ |peak_u−p_A'|=[0.042,0.042,0.042]≤0.12 (ridge lands essentially ON p_A'=0.667). Re-pack-ladder (NON-GATING) η=0.10/0.15/0.25 all → 0.042 / NCOMP 1.0 (robust, not a knife-edge). MECHANISM: the relocation residual is a GEOMETRIC-PLACEMENT problem in 2-D just as in 1-D — drifting the residual phase-1 cells along the categorically-relevant u-axis lands the coherent ridge at the moved line; the extra (irrelevant) dimension does NOT reintroduce incoherence. HONEST RESIDUAL (c9): SPLIT-ONLY also produced NCOMP=1 (a connected ridge); c4 distinctness rests on split-only staying SHORT (4b |·−p_A'|=0.254) AND less concentrated (c4' 0.538<0.689) — the move's distinctness is the RELOCATION + concentration, not connectivity. NO bar moved (R1 NCOMP reported verbatim as the honest catch, c9/c16/p7). HONEST SCOPE (a_scale_honest_scope·a_toy_scale_recheck): DIRECTIONAL numpy mirror, engine-transfer UNVERIFIED (family of H_1333/1340/1343/1352/1360/1364 R1); TOY synthetic 2-D continuum 169 stim/3 seeds/single shift/one frozen η/deterministic readout (tests the 2-D move-the-cells STRUCTURE not a learned drift); AXIS-ALIGNED half-plane boundary ONLY (drift along the single relevant axis) — DIAGONAL/curved 2-D boundaries (H_1343 showed strong diagonal warp), higher-D, real corpora, multi-shift, LEARNED gradient drift, engine-native §CategoricalPerception wiring (a_verified_must_wire) = follow-on; NO human-cognition claim; live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED. .verdicts/1369_cp_2d/result.txt"
  group  = "COGNITION-REPRESENTATION"

@C h1373_hive_nested_universes := "H_1373 — hive-nested-universes: does a NESTED / RECURSIVE universes-within-universes topology ('우주 안의 우주들처럼', user-proposed verbatim) — a cluster of cells is a 'small universe' (its cells share a LOCAL founder) and several clusters are the nodes of a LARGER universe (the cluster-local founders are THEMSELVES coupled to a TOP founder, recursively) — produce a collective faithful-IIT4 Φ that COMPOUNDS ACROSS SCALES and beats the single-scale CENTRALIZED single-shared-founder champion, where every prior SINGLE-SCALE hive lever could not? The hive arc closed 🧱 across FIVE single-scale topologies (strong hub H_1356, weak/decorrelated H_1363, nonlinear-gate H_1370, distributed circle-overlap H_1371); H_1371's load-bearing result: the CENTRALIZED single-shared-founder is the floor-beating MAXIMUM-Φ topology (R2 0/3), so the redundancy ceiling looks like a property of single-scale sharing. H_1373 attacks that with a cosmological-nesting / matryoshka lens (c15, a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall): does MULTI-SCALE recursion break it? Φ = FAITHFUL IIT4 ONLY (a_phi_iit4_tool, exact MIP-EI via hexa stdlib; numpy never computes Φ; O-info diagnostic numpy-side, NEVER gates). Substrate matched to H_1356/H_1320/H_1283/H_1371. Frozen-first (FREEZE committed BEFORE scoring, bars not moved, c9/p7), seeds [1317,1318,1319], $0 CPU." :: hypothesis [slug=1373_hive_nested_universes group=OMEGA]
  method = "state/hive-nested-universes/h1373_hive_nested_universes.py — DIRECTIONAL numpy-mirror (Φ leg IS real exact MIP-EI via hexa-lang/stdlib/consciousness/iit4/faithful_phi.hexa iit4_faithful_phi(state,n=6,dim=T=64,n_bins=8), faithful_phi call REUSED VERBATIM from H_1371; numpy ONLY emits per-unit salience=state-energy traj, hexa computes Φ; NO proxy, p7). Substrate = H_1356/H_1320/H_1283/H_1371: leaky linear recurrent units LEAK=0.55 GAIN=0.30 W_IN=0.5 dim-8 T=64; N_TOT=6 cells = 2 clusters of 3 (c0={0,1,2} c1={3,4,5}, cluster(i)=i//3, n<=8 exact MIP), each cell=1 unit salience=<s_i,s_i>; NO inter-cell recurrent coupling (only cross-cell sharing is via SHARED INPUT). NESTING: 2 INDEPENDENT cluster-LOCAL founders Lc (each read by its 3 cluster cells = small universe, LEVEL-1) + 1 TOP founder TOPF (the larger universe, LEVEL-2); NESTING := each cluster founder ITSELF carries the top founder, L_eff[c]=Lc[c]+TOP_W*TOPF, so the top founder reaches every cell ONLY THROUGH its cluster founder (recursive, NOT flat broadcast). ARMS: FLOOR (private only = no-sharing floor), NESTED (cell i = priv + SHARE_W*(Lc[cluster(i)] + TOP_W*TOPF) = 2-level universes-within-universes), CENTRALIZED (ALL 6 read ONE founder F at 2*OVERLAP_W = single-scale single-shared-founder champion, per-cell shared mass matched to NESTED), SHUFFLE (NESTED inputs but cluster membership randomly re-partitioned -> nesting boundary destroyed, same founders+mass, EARNED control), FLAT (same per-cell shared mass as NESTED but cluster boundary collapsed to ONE global founder Lglobal: cell i = priv + SHARE_W*(Lglobal + TOP_W*TOPF) = single-scale, NO hierarchy -> DISTINCT-FROM-FLAT control R4). SHARE_W=OVERLAP_W=0.6 (=H_1356 W_CONN verbatim), TOP_W=1.0. O-information (Gaussian TC) per arm = NON-GATING diagnostic. FROZEN bars (.verdicts/1373_hive_nested_universes/FREEZE.txt, MARGIN=0.02): GREEN iff R1 (Φ(NESTED)-Φ(FLOOR)>=0.02 forall seed) AND R2 (Φ(NESTED)-Φ(CENTRALIZED)>0 on >=2/3, the multi-scale-escape) AND R3 (Φ(SHUFFLE)<=max(Φ(FLOOR),Φ(CENTRALIZED))+0.02 forall seed) AND R4 (Φ(NESTED)-Φ(FLAT)>0 on >=2/3, hierarchy not mass). live CORE/*.hexa UNTOUCHED. a_no_llm_frame_trap, a_break_the_wall, a_phi_iit4_tool, a_engine_native_learning(transfer DIRECTIONAL), a_verified_must_wire, a_scale_honest_scope, a_toy_scale_recheck."
  verdict = "🧱 NESTED_BELOW_CENTRALIZED (R1 3/3 · R2 0/3 · R3 3/3 · R4 0/3) — the NESTED universes-within-universes does NOT escape the redundancy ceiling; the single-scale CENTRALIZED single-shared-founder produces HIGHER faithful-IIT4 Φ on every seed. per-arm faithful-IIT4 Φ (exact MIP-EI, n=6): seed1317 FLOOR 1.27373 / NESTED 1.67872 / CENTRALIZED 2.40086 / SHUFFLE 1.94625 / FLAT 1.70044; seed1318 1.36292 / 1.92378 / 2.63464 / 1.92378 / 1.98950; seed1319 1.28195 / 1.38299 / 1.86074 / 1.44453 / 1.42483. R2 FAIL (0/3, THE KEY RESULT): Φ(NESTED)−Φ(CENTRALIZED) = −0.72 / −0.71 / −0.48 — nested loses to the single shared founder on EVERY seed; CENTRALIZED is the highest-Φ arm. R1 PASS (3/3): lift = Φ(NESTED)−Φ(FLOOR) = +0.405 / +0.561 / +0.101 (nested robustly beats floor, but below the ceiling). R3 PASS (3/3): Φ(SHUFFLE) <= max(floor,central)+0.02 every seed (1.95<=2.40, 1.92<=2.63, 1.44<=1.86). R4 FAIL (0/3, LOAD-BEARING for this lens): Φ(NESTED)−Φ(FLAT) = −0.02 / −0.07 / −0.04 — a FLAT single-scale topology with the SAME shared mass but the cluster boundary collapsed to one global founder MATCHES/EXCEEDS nested -> the HIERARCHY itself adds NOTHING; only the concentration/total of the shared source determines Φ. SETUP INTEGRITY: FLOOR Φ (1.27373/1.36292/1.28195) is BYTE-IDENTICAL to H_1371 A_independent (same substrate confirmed). O-info per arm (NON-GATING): all arms O<0; NESTED O (−0.063/−0.050/−0.277) is CLOSER TO ZERO than CENTRALIZED (−0.139/−0.370/−0.185) — nested is LESS redundant but ALSO less synergistic (O flattens toward 0, never goes more-negative); consistent with its lower Φ (same pattern as H_1371). MECHANISM (faithful-MIP lens): a single dominant shared source (CENTRALIZED) binds ALL units across EVERY partition (cut cost HIGH -> Φ high); NESTED lets the MIP cut cheaply along the cluster boundary (the top founder is doubly-diluted through the cluster founder) -> Φ low; R4 is decisive — same mass placed FLAT (one global founder, no level boundary) tie